the atoms this program writes -> [:ok, :error, :pending]
a name it writes -> :ok
  and it is that very atom -> true
another of them -> :pending
one written nowhere -> ()
the empty name -> ()
asking did not create it -> ()
a name built at run time -> :ok
not a string -> <error :type_error to_existing_atom needs a string>
an atom is not a name -> <error :type_error to_existing_atom needs a string>
found 100000 times -> 100000
missed 100000 times -> 0
